{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15112430","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15112430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1511243001:0":{"text":"네, 네가...","source_cn":"你……你居然……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03C03984DEF53F6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511243002:0":{"text":"설마 내가 이길 줄 몰랐던 거야?","source_cn":"没想到我能打败你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF6E9AA7FDD1481","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511243003:0":{"text":"너무 늙어서 자기 나이를 까먹은 모양이네. 넌 이미 젊은이들의 상대가 안 돼.","source_cn":"你老了，老得连自己的年岁都忘记。你的动作早就跟不上年轻人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C3E0F5331B979D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511243004:0":{"text":"어이! 내가 고르단을 이겼으니까, 이제 내가 수장인 거지?","source_cn":"喂，按照传统，打赢了戈丹，我就是下一任首领，没错吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA74125BC182EA6E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511243005:0":{"text":"마... 맞습니다...","source_cn":"呃……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D68940ADB5C10E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511243006:0":{"text":"하지만 아쉽게도 <style=\"highlight\">난 수장이 될 생각은 전혀 없어</style>. 아쿠보르의 나무는 이미 썩어서 껍질만 남았고, 다른 곳도 전부 곪아 터졌거든.","source_cn":"但是真遗憾，<style=highlight>我不想当...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97BEAB580AA032D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511243007:0":{"text":"난 고르단을 처형하지 않을 거야. 세월에 깎이고 부스러기가 될 때까지 살려두겠어.","source_cn":"我不会处决戈丹，让他活着，继续被时间风化磨碎吧，直到变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE485D751C7A382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511243008:0":{"text":"그리고 난 아쿠보르를 떠날 거야!","source_cn":"而我，我要离开雅库伯尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE46D97BA41219F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511243009:0":{"text":"틸로아?!","source_cn":"缇洛亚？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6E0FE634F02C176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511243010:1":{"text":"난 여기를 떠나서 전설 속 유토피아라는, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 말한 <style=\"highlight\">땅거미 숲</style>으로 갈 거야.","source_cn":"我要离开这里，去传说中的理想乡，去<style=str...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A65469DC0E62537","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 여기를 떠나서 전설 속 유토피아라는, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 말한 <style=\"highlight\">땅거미 숲</style>으로 갈 거야.","female":"난 여기를 떠나서 전설 속 유토피아라는, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 말한 <style=\"highlight\">땅거미 숲</style>으로 갈 거야.","variant_male_record_index":"189987","variant_female_record_index":"189988","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511243011:0":{"text":"우드테일 말이 맞아. 아무리 멀어도 방향만 맞으면 언젠가는 도착할 수 있겠지.","source_cn":"椴尾说得对，不论多远，只要方向正确，总有一天能走到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDECA7D81E90005C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511243012:0":{"text":"헛소리...! 아쿠보르 밖의 짐승이 너를 갈기갈기 찢을 거다...!","source_cn":"不自量力……！雅库伯尔外的野兽会将你撕碎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE40CD960BD38DD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511243013:0":{"text":"패배자 주제에 혀가 왜 그렇게 길어?!","source_cn":"手下败将，还嘴硬什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00FDA82F244741BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511243014:0":{"text":"자, 땅거미 숲으로 갈 사람들은 날 따라와!","source_cn":"——来吧。想一起去薄暮丛林的人，就跟我来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07D50F306939EAEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:戈丹":{"text":"고르단","source":"戈丹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:缇洛亚":{"text":"틸로아","source":"缇洛亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:树怒